  "contract": "Requires ClassicPlus.CombatRules=1 and CoA.ItemScaling.Native.RebornArmor=1 with ItemAddon.dbc. Four level 60 Reapers strip their starter gear (252 armor from 126 Agility) and wear one six-piece set of Lieutenant Thorne's CoA PvP Gear each. Expected armor = 252 + the pieces' reborn armor (ItemAddon.dbc field 43) + equip effects + 2 x the Agility they add: Field Doctor's Satin (set 531) 744 + Field Doctor's Satin Handwraps' 'Increases armor by 250' (536254); Cutthroat's Leather (1259) 1314 + 2 x 123 Agility; Pursuer's Chain (1266) 2090 + 2 x 161 Agility; Harrowed Champion (1263) 3617. A level 60 Reaper's 1000 blow then keeps 5500 / (armor + 5500), rounded up.",
